    "text": "<p>In figure, a straight line is given for Freundrich Adsorption <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>505</mn><mo>)</mo></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>logK</mi></math> are respectively.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/2e773749-266d-450f-a9d6-e566103dd338-9896738.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 373px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
